        "question": {
          ":question/id": "4deeccc4-d68f-5ea2-a608-c73926440101",
          ":question/problem": "Let $b=\\langle 4,0,-3\\rangle$ and $a=\\langle 1,-2,-2\\rangle$. Find $\\operatorname{comp}_{b}a-\\operatorname{comp}_{a}b$.",
          ":question/worked-solution": "Using the scalar projection formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(1)(4)+(-2)(0)+(-2)(-3)}{\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+{0}^{2}+(-3)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4+0+6}{\\sqrt{25}} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{\\sqrt{25}} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{b\\cdot a}{|\\,a\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{b}_{x}{a}_{x}+{b}_{y}{a}_{y}+{b}_{z}{a}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+(-2)^{2}+(-2)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{\\sqrt{9}} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a-{\\text{comp}}_{a}\\,b & =2-\\frac{10}{3} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
